name: agentbridge
base: core24
version: @@VERSION@@
summary: Self-hosted AI personal assistant
description: |
  AgentBridge is a self-hosted AI personal assistant (AGPL-3.0). It runs its own agents
  behind two interfaces in a single process: a full-screen chat terminal (TUI) and an
  HTTP API speaking the standard OpenAI protocol. Chat in the terminal while scripts,
  bots and apps use the same agents on the same port.

  This classic-confinement snap ships the official self-contained release archive. The
  engine's user configuration (PersistentData) is kept next to the executable, so the
  launcher materializes the payload into the per-user SNAP_USER_DATA on first run and
  refreshes it on upgrades (version marker in the snap).

  Homepage: https://github.com/Graphene-Lab/AgentBridge
grade: stable
confinement: classic

apps:
  agentbridge:
    command: bin/agentbridge-launcher
  agentbridge-headless:
    command: bin/agentbridge-launcher
    args: [--headless]

parts:
  engine:
    plugin: dump
    source: https://github.com/Graphene-Lab/AgentBridge/releases/download/v@@VERSION@@/agentbridge-linux-x64.tar.gz
    source-type: tar
    source-checksum: sha256/@@SHA256@@
  launcher:
    plugin: dump
    source: files
